{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49936","headline":"雨中花 · 吕岩","name":"雨中花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三百年间，功标青史，几多俱委埃尘。\n悟黄粱弃事，厌世藏身。\n将我一枝丹桂，换他千载青春。\n岳阳楼上，纶巾羽扇，谁识天人。\n蓬莱愿应仙举，谁知会合仙宾。\n遥想望，吹笙玉殿，奏舞鸾裀。\n风驭云軿不散，碧桃紫奈长新。\n愿逢一粒，九霞光里，相继朝真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}